 * @im: image to check
 * @n: number of bands, or 1
 *
 * Check that an image has 1 or @n bands. Handy for unary operations, cf.
 * vips_check_bands_1orn().
 * If not, set an error message
 * and return non-zero.
 *
 * See also: vips_check_bands_1orn().
 *
 * Returns: 0 on OK, or -1 on error.
